        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 7.04 The Employer agrees to pay into the Safety Clothing and Education Fund, known as the Local Union #51/NECA Safety Clothing and Education Fund, one-half percent (1/2%) of their gross labor payroll paid to all employees covered by this Agreement. The contribution of the Employer shall be used to provide Education & Training to eligible employees of Employers working under this agreement in such form and amount as the trustees of the Plan may determine and to provide funds for the organization and administration expenses of the Plan. Delinquencies to this plan shall be handled in the same manner as those to the NEFE as outlined in Section 8.01 of this agreement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                120,
                736,
                1069,
                1025
